    "Before geometry detection, numeric zero uses the existing pinned complex none-template algorithm only for valid native percentage fields and equivalent native translation/origin array leaves. Source-normalized zero endpoints remain normalized rather than restoring authored numeric zero; unsupported strings, CSS units, colors and unrelated structured fields retain their existing native authority guards.",
